es selected from train may contain label noise. The validation-gated parent fallback limits score regression, but sorting users, rescoring train rows, and dense Adam pairwise updates add several seconds; fine-tuning is skipped when less than roughly eight seconds of budget remain.", "est_runtime_sec": 30, "status": "ok", "metrics": {"GAUC": 0.6682155309533149, "nDCG@5": 0.5358566381293559, "primary": 0.6020360845413354}, "delta_vs_baseline_valid_primary": 0.00043608454133536867, "seconds": 23.806001663208008, "best_so_far": {"node_id": "n0011", "valid_primary": 0.6020360845413354}, "events": [], "usage": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 4873, "output_tokens": 7587, "cost_usd": 0.16309959999999998}, "cumulative": {"total_iterations": 11, "scored_iterations": 12, "cost_usd": 1.8826541599999997, "wall_seconds": 4340.9195783138275}, "iteration": 11, "wall_seconds_this_iteration": 467.0267593860626}
